  "translation": "And behold, the whole clan rose against your maidservant and said, “Give up ⟨את⟩ the striker of his brother, and we will put him to death for the life of his brother whom he killed, and we will destroy also ⟨את⟩ the heir, and they will quench ⟨את⟩ my ember that remains, so as not to set for my husband name or remnant on the face of the ground.”",
